# One-off operations on this installation's data. Gitignored, which is not the
# same as excluded from a build: the builder does `COPY . .` and never consults
# git, so a script holding real figures was copied into the image and shipped
# with it. Note that `*.sql` above matches root-level files only, which is why
# ops/*.sql got through.
#
# The migrations under drizzle/ are deliberately NOT excluded — the image runs
# them on startup.
ops/

# The development stack. A release has no business carrying the means to run a
# second instance of itself.
docker-compose.dev.yml
docker-compose.*.yml

# Instructions to whoever works on this, not to whoever runs it.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
backup/
nginx/
# Secrets: never bake into image layers / build context
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# tests / CI: not needed in the image
.test-build
tsconfig.test.json
**/*.test.ts
.github
